0.4.19\",\n    \"postcss\": \"^8.4.38\",\n    \"tailwindcss\": \"^3.4.3\",\n    \"vite\": \"^5.2.0\"\n  }\n}\n","Path":"C:\\Users\\pinkm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a5b231a2-4f86-4de8-aef6-e2920d9db8fb\\react-vite-project\\package.json"}}]}
